[0.006, "o", "\u001b[23B\u001b[0m============================================================\u001b[25;1H Demo 4: from a push to a running, verified image\u001b[26;1H \b\n \u001b[H\u001b[26B One 'git push'. GitHub delivers it to the cluster, a build\u001b[28;1H starts on its own, and the image it produces is signed,\u001b[29;1H logged and admitted. Nothing after the push is run by hand\u001b[30;1H except the last command, which deploys the result.\u001b[31;1H============================================================\u001b[32;1H \u001b[H"]
